  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T15:06:21.594Z",
  "published_at": "2026-08-12T15:06:21.580Z",
  "id": 203716269584332,
  "uuid": "d76eaac1-00ab-4d05-91b7-5323424e042c",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "3bf55e2e-18d8-ba2a-666d-cc0b82bf939d",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "07619376-64eb-2989-9f1f-232526ed013b",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "In the East, for some it means the ideal standards by which Muslims strive to live. For others, it is the greatest obstacle to the modernisation of their societies. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "These clashing views can sometimes be the cause of conflict and the latest publication produced by the ISMC, ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "What is the Sharia?",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": ", sheds light on the evolution and implementation of this contested concept at multiple levels. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "On the one hand the book explores the idea of Sharia as a pluralistic concept and focuses on the actual uses of the term (rather than some imagined ideal), and on the other it provides an overview of the history of the Islamic legal tradition helpful to scholars and students wishing to be initiated to the subject. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
